/-!
# The second Tits core: center geometry and action census

The center has order four and its centralizer in the second parabolic is
exactly the core. The actual model and inner action images have orders 1536
and 256. The marked outer quotient is C₂² × S₄, with exactly the inner kernel.
The order-six census in that quotient proves actual overgroup conjugacy
in `action_census`. The earlier conditional reduction remains available.

Source: Parrott (1972), §5, p.683; Aschbacher--Smith F.1.12 and14.2.21,
printed pp.263 and988--989.
-/
